    "content" : "The selection of the most suitable optimization algorithm for similar flow field reconstruction method was previously addressed in [47], where the performance, efficiency, robustness, and scalability of various methods were evaluated, leading to the adoption of PSO as the preferred approach for this type of modeling. Although the authors noted that optimization outcomes are case-dependent, they observed similar results across different test cases due to the synthetic nature of the simulations, despite variations in data sources."
